{"path":"header/rcu","title":"Standard library header <rcu> (C++26)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">Standard library header</span> &lt;rcu&gt;&nbsp;<span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/header/rcu","section":"header","kind":"page","summary":"This header is part of the thread support library.","html":"<p>This header is part of the <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread\">thread support</a> library.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h3 id=\"Classes\">Classes</h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rcu_obj_base</span></span></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  allows an object to be protected by RCU <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rcu_domain</span></span></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  provides regions of RCU protection <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h3 id=\"Functions\">Functions</h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rcu_default_domain</span></span></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns a reference to a static-duration object of type <code>std::rcu_domain</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rcu_synchronize</span></span></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span></span></spa